# Line-ending policy.
#
# Text is normalised to LF in the repo and handed out native on checkout.
# Binary files must be exempt: demonstrated 2026-09-05 that without this, a
# fresh checkout on Windows grew dist/picks_2026_week1.pdf from 3802 to 3876
# bytes by injecting 74 CRLF pairs, breaking its startxref table and mangling
# its text encoding. The repo blob was fine; the damage happened on checkout,
# so it was invisible to anyone working on Linux.

* text=auto

*.pdf   binary
*.parquet binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip   binary
